{
  "info": {
    "name": "PPM — CS2032 Grupo 4",
    "description": "SaaS de Project Portfolio Management. 6 microservicios serverless\nmulti-tenant en AWS.\n\nCOMO USARLA\n1. Corre '1. Login Acme'. El token se guarda SOLO en la variable\n   {{token}} y lo usan todas las demas peticiones.\n2. Para cambiar de tenant, corre '1. Login Globex'.\n\nEl tenant_id viaja DENTRO del token, nunca en la URL ni en el body.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "identidad",
      "value": "https://hw5b5suj23.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/dev"
    },
    {
      "key": "portafolios",
      "value": "https://c78c035rtl.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/dev"
    },
    {
      "key": "tareas",
      "value": "https://yq369o7q4k.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/dev"
    },
    {
      "key": "recursos",
      "value": "https://sitxbs7ytj.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/dev"
    },
    {
      "key": "presupuestos",
      "value": "https://xqk5r0tbq3.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/dev"
    },
    {
      "key": "analitico",
